message: "If you use these figures, please cite them as below."
title: "Swiss household employment: official figures and canton rules 2026"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Clino"
    website: "https://clino.ch"
version: "2026.1"
date-released: "2026-10-01"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://clino.ch/en/mcp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/salvador-creator/clino-mcp"
abstract: >-
  The contribution rates, thresholds, minimum wages, family allowances and
  canton rules that apply when a private household in Switzerland employs a
  cleaner, nanny or carer, for all 26 cantons and the 2026 rates year. Each of
  the 151 figures carries its official source document, URL, verbatim quote
  and verification date. The same data powers the Clino MCP server
  (https://clino.ch/mcp).
keywords:
  - Switzerland
  - household employment
  - domestic workers
  - social insurance
  - AHV
  - minimum wage
  - payroll
  - open data
  - Model Context Protocol
